{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46002","headline":"登鄱阳寺阁 · 贯休","name":"登鄱阳寺阁","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"寺楼闲纵望，不觉到斜晖。\n故国在何处，多年未得归。\n寒江平楚外，细雨一鸿飞。\n终斅於陵子，吴山有绿薇。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"贯休","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_46002.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46002","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}